# Deny by default: only reviewed, portable source files may be committed.
# This also excludes new local data and credentials created in the future.
*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/.env.example
!/run-discord-mcp.mjs

# Never add exceptions for TOKEN.txt, real .env files, local MCP configs,
# agent memories/settings, notes with Discord IDs, logs, backups, or binaries.
# Review both content and privacy before adding another allowlisted file.
